          "short": "$0.1118\\text{ km}^2$",
          "worked": "One square kilometre is $1000000\\text{ m}^2$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}A&=111800\\div1000000\\\\&=0.1118\\text{ km}^2.\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      }
